14	/**
15	 * Returns true if the two arrays or objects are shallow equal, or false
16	 * otherwise. Also handles primitive values, just in case.
17	 *
18	 * @param {unknown} a First object or array to compare.
19	 * @param {unknown} b Second object or array to compare.
